<title>USA: FMR group cuts stake in Empresas ICA stake.</title>
<headline>FMR group cuts stake in Empresas ICA stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by  FMR Corp said Friday it cut its stake in Empresas ICA Sociedad Controladora to 475,162 American Depositary Receipts, or 1.91 percent of the class outstanding, from 5.27 percent held on July 29.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the sale of 785,800 ADRs between August 22 and August 28 at prices ranging from $15.16 to $15.78 per share.</p>
</text>
